cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "Autan: a GPU-native unstructured finite-volume CFD solver"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cruvellier
    given-names: Baptiste
    alias: Remenby31
abstract: >-
  A GPU-native, cell-centred finite-volume solver for compressible flow on
  unstructured meshes of arbitrary polyhedra, with a discrete adjoint on the
  GPU and a typed Python SDK. Pre-alpha: nothing runs yet.
repository-code: https://github.com/Remenby31/autan
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - finite volume
  - unstructured mesh
  - polyhedral mesh
  - GPU
  - CUDA
  - HIP
  - discrete adjoint
